}

### ===== SUBTASK TAGS API =====

### 13. Get all visible tags (global + user's own)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subtask-tags
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 14. Get all global tags (Admin only)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subtask-tags/global
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 15. Create a USER-SPECIFIC tag
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subtask-tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Performance Optimization",
  "color": "#9333ea",
  "isGlobal": false
}

### 16. Create a GLOBAL tag (Admin only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subtask-tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Security",
  "color": "#dc2626",
  "isGlobal": true
}

### 17. Get tag by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subtask-tags/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 18. Update tag
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/subtask-tags/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Frontend Development",
  "color": "#3b82f6"
}

### 19. Delete tag
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/subtask-tags/13
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 20. Get tags by IDs (batch)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subtask-tags/batch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

[1, 2, 3, 4]

###
